{"ID":"20240515131409-08dxatr","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240515131409-08dxatr","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240515131409-08dxatr\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240515141125-wpopkg0\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240515141125-wpopkg0\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:200,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240515141125-wpopkg0\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:432,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:432\u0026#125;","title":"066","type":"doc","updated":"20240515171207"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240515141125-wpopkg0","Type":"NodeTable","TableAligns":[0],"Properties":{"colgroup":"width: 839px;","id":"20240515141125-wpopkg0","updated":"20240515171207"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableHead","Data":"thead","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪醫師病案紀錄"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 初診日期：2008/08/29"}]}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"姓名"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"LJ"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"性別："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"F"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"年齡及體型"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"47歲 160cm 50kg"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診日期："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2008/08/29"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診原因："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"今年一月發現乳癌，3/20做過切片。有吃鈣片（ß快停掉），沒吃乳製品。停經前４、５年有吃痛經止痛藥。"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"問診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"１右乳時刺痛，無定處（切片後嚴重許多），多在心包經上"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"２月經停了有兩年（2006開始無經）"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"３雙足冷"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"４睡不好"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"５大便每日行，未盡感"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"６小便淡白"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"７口渴無，逼自己喝水→裡寒"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"８自覺體內冷"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"９不易出汗，胃口好。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"脈診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"沉小，細，無力→秋得冬脈很好治"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"望診：\n1、舌診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"淡紅黃（好治）"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"2、眼診 :"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"特殊診斷："}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"耳診："}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"診斷："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 裡寒之人，心陽不足"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"中藥處方： "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生附子二錢（另包）　乾薑二錢　炙甘草五錢　桂枝四錢　白芍四錢　當歸二錢　"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"細辛二錢　木通三錢　防己五錢　牡蠣一兩　瓦楞子五錢　川芎三錢　黃耆五錢"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拾付　"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"九碗煮三碗水　"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"早晚飯前"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"解說： "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"１手足冰冷加重桂枝白芍到四錢，無積水可以加重炙甘草到五錢。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"２大便不通加重木通到三錢，下焦寒用細辛，防己入三焦淋巴。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"３左血右氣，因在右邊所以加黃耆補氣行氣，若在左邊則加重活血化瘀的藥，如茜草、牛膝、三七、續斷。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]}]}]}